---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import { siteIdentity } from "@features/seo/site-metadata";
---

<Layout>
  <div
    class="mx-auto min-h-screen max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 text-foreground md:px-8"
  >
    <h1 class="mb-6 animate-fade-up text-4xl font-semibold">About</h1>
    <div class="flex animate-fade-up animation-delay-100 flex-col gap-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I'm {siteIdentity.name}, a full-stack developer. I started programming in 2013 and began working
        professionally in 2018. My experience spans public safety, finance, and intellectual property.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work across the stack, from interfaces and APIs to infrastructure and databases. My main
        tools include TypeScript, React, Angular, C#, Go, SQL, Azure, Kubernetes, Helm, and OpenTofu.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is a record of the things I make and learn. Alongside software projects and writing,
        it includes photography, graphics, music, and other creative experiments.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can read about my professional experience on the <a
          href="/cv"
          class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground/70">CV</a> page, or browse the
        projects and creative work from the home page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
